<title>USA: Unisys unit wins U.S. Air Force contract.</title>
<headline>Unisys unit wins U.S. Air Force contract.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unisys Corp said Monday that its Federal Systems Division has won a subcontract from SRA International Inc for the U.S. Air Force.</p>
<p>The five-year multiple award, contract has a total value of $929 million, the company said.</p>
<p>Contractors will provide systems integration, security services, workstations, networking equipment and mapping and imaging software, the company said. It said its Federal Systems Division will provide support services for automated military and civilian intelligence centers.</p>
</text>
